;; Drives timer.clj for docs/demos/timer.gif.
;;
;; The only flow with no interaction at all: this demo advances on its own, so
;; the recording just needs to stay open and watch. glitter's own manifest treats
;; its timer the same way — {:duration 10} with no :input.
;;
;; The tap partway through changes the duration mid-run, which is the actual
;; 7GUIs challenge for this task: the change must take effect immediately rather
;; than at the next tick.
[[:wait-for-quiescence 3000]
 [:wait-for-quiescence 3000]
 [:tap-by-role {:role "AXButton" :text "Reset"}]
 [:wait-for-quiescence 3000]
 [:wait-for-quiescence 2000]]
